  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot TRAIDE Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims first and foremost to contribute to a more sustainable and inclusive economy in Rwanda, which includes a self-sustaining process of increasing sustainable trade and investment between Rwanda and the Netherlands. Three outcomes are envisioned to reach long-term impact:&#x2022;	Improved market readiness in Rwanda, such as improved value chains, infrastructure and/or a strong local private sector that can absorb foreign investments and develop a mutually beneficial relationship with Dutch companies.&#x2022;	Improved business environment on the public side, such as updated laws and regulations and clarity on taxation, which supports Dutch companies to invest in and trade with Rwandan counterparts.&#x2022;	An improved understanding of local trade facilitation and ways to support an increase in trade and investment between African countries and the Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
